comments:
I am leaning toward fixing this only in 6.0.0 without porting the fix into 5.0.0. While it's unfortunate, the impact seems low overall--it only affects 2 property setters and only surfaces on 2 platforms.  This was a good find, @Youssef1313; I presume you found it by way of reading code and documentation--is that right?

If we ship 5.0 with this as a known issue, the workaround will be very straightforward -- to wrap calls to set these properties on `macos` or `freebsd` with `#pragma warning disable CA1416`.

@terrajobst also commented above that he would not consider this release-blocking.  @adamsitnik / @eiriktsarpalis, what do you think?
